# Hand-written CIF for MOTIF's examples and tests. Not taken from any database.
#
# The CoSn (B35) structure type, the textbook kagome metal: Co atoms form a kagome net in the
# plane z = 0 with one Sn in each hexagon; a honeycomb layer of Sn lies at z = 1/2.
# Space group P6/mmm (no. 191): Co on 3f (1/2, 0, 0), Sn on 1a (0, 0, 0) and 2d (1/3, 2/3, 1/2).
# The cell lengths are rounded, illustrative values. The symmetry operations were written out
# with gemmi.
data_CoSn_type
_chemical_name_common            'CoSn type (kagome)'
_chemical_formula_sum            'Co Sn'
_cell_length_a                   5.279
_cell_length_b                   5.279
_cell_length_c                   4.259
_cell_angle_alpha                90
_cell_angle_beta                 90
_cell_angle_gamma                120
_space_group_name_H-M_alt        'P 6/m m m'
_space_group_IT_number           191
